{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "012yus_402_2_4_012_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:eeea6344ab8e778c5768ed7af1818416c9948de6db140ab55c43663576cacbd6",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:012yus_402_2_4_012_02_09_a:2_4_012_02_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05ca136d568a02cf9a0d129b8837e46975008e00b343aeef46fcd466698b2786",
      "text": "啊，●●●●●●●●●●监督？\n辛苦啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_402_2_4_012_02_09_a:2_4_012_02_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ee9207b67bb8ff43a464d106cf6e3087e4645779f084d5dc0c2ed251e0434f1",
      "text": "回到家之后走T台时的心跳加速还是\n平静不下来，忍不住就打电话过来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_402_2_4_012_02_09_a:2_4_012_02_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b47e17e145824d77f704afee054079c4d84418dc3e4283a37d86a3481876495",
      "text": "今天的我，在监督眼里看起来是什么样的？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_402_2_4_012_02_09_a:2_4_012_02_09_a:cmd-000012:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5103572be5d2f2ac2ed47da175a126f76c008db78f3ca58e1d972131a5327bb0",
      "text": "很有成熟大人的气质，\n很迷人",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_402_2_4_012_02_09_a:2_4_012_02_09_a:cmd-000013:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe21901ec9526d0086fc7c8a26a46afdb9b47335297e833813046a520c7693a7",
      "text": "简直像变了个人，\n吓了我一跳",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_402_2_4_012_02_09_a:2_4_012_02_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd43ec012e8daf82dc444c7f15ee82fbc1197143a6665910f5a5d7dcb14f400b",
      "text": "这样啊，看起来是那样吗。\n总觉得有点开心♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_402_2_4_012_02_09_a:2_4_012_02_09_a:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f591ff11a3abd43e801015b1d2fe511728ad953fac2c29398480b103dd0b4646",
      "text": "真的吗？我也觉得\n跟平时有点不太一样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_402_2_4_012_02_09_a:2_4_012_02_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab9b211f0d403806abeb3798b4385fee89175d8af5360e28006b5a82fbf6fc75",
      "text": "时装秀是以展示衣服为目的的，\n模特必须展现出衣服的魅力才行对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_402_2_4_012_02_09_a:2_4_012_02_09_a:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ae4bbba5b040fad889131b074c8c4b58ea54e1acd7f494946b85ffad2d77e83",
      "text": "我可是带着成为让那套衣服看起来最帅气的\n模特的觉悟去走的哦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_402_2_4_012_02_09_a:2_4_012_02_09_a:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5097a6dc3623f31ee77ecb7695570f36803aab8af680d9a3e1f9183e6b5f66d1",
      "text": "感觉还有点没从时装秀的余韵中走出来呢。\n虽然不知道能不能睡着，不过晚安啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
